  - var current = "theater"

block content
  article
    header
      h1
        a(href='../../../../2011/was-geschah-mit-dem-bohnenpaar-platypus-theater/') Was geschah mit dem Bohnenpaar?
      time(pubdate) May 27, 2011
    p
      | I made music and sound for a play in German for children aged 4 and up for Platypus Theater. The piece is about two beans who need to learn to sprout so they can survive the winter.
      br
      | Some excerpts from the premiere in May 2011:
    .embed-container
      iframe(src='https://player.vimeo.com/video/57196145' frameborder='0' webkitallowfullscreen mozallowfullscreen allowfullscreen).


    p …and a sound which didn’t make it into the video: Here the wind is blowing the beans, scattering and separating them:
    // [if lt IE 9]><script>document.createElement('audio');</script><![endif]
    audio.wp-audio-shortcode#audio-350-1(preload='none' style='width: 100%;' controls)
      source(type='audio/mpeg' src='../../../../wp-content/uploads/2011/05/blown-by-wind.mp3')
      a(href='../../../../wp-content/uploads/2011/05/blown-by-wind.mp3') https://leoauri.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/05/blown-by-wind.mp3
  article
    header
      h1
        a(href='../../../../2010/tortilla-curtain-platypus-theater/') Tortilla Curtain with Platypus Theater
      time(pubdate) November 5, 2010
    p
      | A new play with 
      a(href='http://www.platypus-theater.de/') Platypus Theater
      | .. This time a piece for young adults, an adaptation of T. C. Boyle’s book “Tortilla Curtain”. I contributed the music and sound effects and coached the actors’ musical performance.
    p Some excerpts from the premiere on 4/11/2010:
    .embed-container
      iframe(src='https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/fpwcCq2D_cs?rel=0' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen).


    p
      | The voice of actress 
      a(href='http://www.vimeo.com/andreapanilaura') Andrea Pani Laura
      |  was featured extensively, who plays the role of “America”.
    p
      | I used numerous samples from 
      a(href='http://www.freesound.org/') freesound.org
      |  for the job (see 
      a(href='../../../../2011/freesound-attributions/') attributions
      | ), along with my own field recordings, all of which I mashed together into a delicious Brei.
    p
      | For more information and performance dates check out the 
      a(href='http://www.platypus-theater.de/') Platypus Theater website
      | .
  nav
    a(href='../../') « Previous Page

